{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_thorns_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_thorns_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Anniversary",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_thorns_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "353f2f2bca6d04d9f210325734fbeefb4836d745a3890e6f720cf235f7042b30",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Welcome!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, you're..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "One set meal to go, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's the money."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay, exact change... No, wait a second!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you doing here? And your clothes... Did another experiment go wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, it went well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just a bit of an accident at the end. No problem at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You call that 'no problem'... I'll never understand you outsiders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Also, didn't I say I'd deliver meals for you and Felipe? If you just come here like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The eyes in the small tavern converge upon the two, most of them not exactly friendly.\nAll around, conversations cut themselves off as the other customers take in the presence of the unfamiliar Ægir face.\nThe silence is soon replaced by excited whispers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is that the one? The outsider here for some sort of 'cooperation.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like a normal guy to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shh, he's Ægir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Didn't the Inquisition agree to allow their return?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can't trust everything you hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't want to get dragged into it if he gets arrested or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Things may have gotten better in recent years, but don't tell me you forgot how it was a decade ago, when the Inquisition was dragging people off on the regular."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course I haven't. I was young then, but I remember being interrogated for a long time. I was almost taken away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're right, better safe than sorry. He's Ægir, after all..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Noisy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Ægir casually picks up the cup from the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then he lets it slip from his fingers, and it shatters on the ground with a bang.\nThe tavern instantly quiets down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He didn't hear us, did he?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Customer",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shh, who knows? Best keep our mouths shut."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll pay for the cup."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...That's not what I'm concerned about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, don't worry about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I should be saying that... er, don't worry about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're not bad people. It's just that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not a problem. Just a matter of getting used to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But isn't it hard to take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I heard from the mayor that you and your friends are here to help us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're the ones asking for help, yet we're treating you like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? You misunderstand me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't care what other people think of me. What I meant was that the rest of you Iberians have to get used to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Inquisition has made its choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A window has opened. Ægirs who were once forced to leave are now returning. There will only be more of us in the future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you've decided to accept our help, then you need to get used to seeing us on the streets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Is that why you go out for a walk in town every day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not just walking, I'm measuring. I need to know how wide the roads are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I was surprised to find that time seems to have stopped for decades here. Many things need to be fixed or replaced."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the same thing... walking on the streets like you own the place. All the customers have been talking about you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doesn't matter to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha... alright, as long as you're okay with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So how are preparations going with you and Felipe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you planning a surprise? Felipe said it was a celebration... but I don't remember any festive dates this time of year."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm just helping out. Felipe has a good idea; we just need to hammer out the details."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You'll know more soon enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not about to do anything crazy, are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I heard there were festivals that last for days, with flowers and cheering crowds everyday, and fireworks in broad daylight... I can't even imagine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We haven't had anything like that for a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not too late."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Felipe wants everyone to be able to participate, like in the Iberia of yore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is he still reading those books? <i>The Adventures of Captain Alfonso</i>, <i>The Pirate King and the Golden Kingdom</i>... he hasn't outgrown them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nothing wrong with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Iberia in its Golden Age may have been arrogant, but at least there was something to be proud of, compared to the shambled state it's in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Felipe has a knack for working with machines. He really should go out into the world and broaden his horizons, if the opportunity presents itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go out and see the world..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That would be really nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's your set meal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And this one's for Felipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Treat it as a token of appreciation on behalf of the others. To tell the truth, I'm kind of looking forward to the surprise you and Felipe are planning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I hope it'll be like in the books."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay? What do you mean—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Weird guy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g17_lighthouse_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hold it, Felipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Didn't you hear us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Did you need something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm in a hurry. If you don't have anything important—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where do you think you're going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not fiddling around with that Ægir again, are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's none of your business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Besides, Mr. Thorns is here by invitation. You should show some respect."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Respect is one thing, keeping your distance is another."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Besides, he won't even tell you his real name, just a code name. Who's to say he didn't use to be a bandit or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mr. Thorns said he's an employee of Rhodes Island!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's an Iberian expatriate, forced to leave after certain events..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rhodes what? Never heard of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And what events, exactly? How do we know for sure he's not the same as those crazy Ægir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe he's one that the Inquisition is after, just good at hiding things—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shut up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is all baseless accusation, pure speculation!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't any of you remember that tomorrow is—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tomorrow is what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...You'll find out tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I trust the Inquisition's judgment. And I know that Mr. Thorns isn't like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Alright, Felipe, I guess I went too far. That Ægir—the one who calls himself Thorns—may be useful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As for tomorrow, I'm not sure what you're planning... but we'll be waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tense Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just remember that we're really worried about you. You should open your eyes and stay away from the Ægir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Was that my fault?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "People like you may be a minority among the Iberians."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mr. Thorns?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When did you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "From 'fiddling around with that Ægir again.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here, this is from Martín's Tavern."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, thank you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait a second! I'm so sorry about just now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They aren't bad people. Please don't take it personally."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're just concerned... We don't see a lot of outsiders here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My head hurts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't like being apologized to over and over again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "S-Sorry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Ægir who has returned to his homeland in a manner he never expected sighs.\nThe past is buried deep in his heart. He can overlook a lot of things, but there is something different about this place and the people who live here.\nThat is why he stands here now, as an Ægir.\nBecause he has the ability to do so. Following his heart, he came back to the place that he never thought he would come back to."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's nothing to apologize for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have you finished calibrating the... what was it, 'Automatic Perpetual Sugar Sprayer'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It fell quite a bit short of 'perpetual' in the last test."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, yes! I was just about to tell you. I think I'm about to make some real progress in efficiency and endurance!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's all thanks to that manuscript from Weedy you brought."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank her yourself if you have the chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Along with the concoction that you prepared, everyone will be so surprised tomorrow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, by the way, I want to make some improvements to what I brewed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Have you ever seen the 'Midday Flame'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "M-Mr. Thorns!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*cough*, *cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A-Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just got the ratios wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Things don't look fine to me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look, your hair got burnt!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? Oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just shave it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you doing with the knife? Wait! Don't cut it like that—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For heaven's sake, at least let me do it for you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er, haha, it's nothing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, that should do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You should keep your distance, to be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are your experiments always so dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They invited you here, but then put you out in the middle of nowhere, without proper facilities..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's fine, this is a good place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have all the basics here. Anything more complex probably needs an application anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Application?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To the Inquisition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Years ago, they arrested a lot of people, confiscating everything that the Islanders brought. Technology that has been lost to modern-day Iberia may still be found within the Inquisition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And now it's time to put it to use."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are no Ægir left in this town."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There used to be some, years ago. I heard that when my parents were young, everyone was treated the same way, whether they were Liberi or Ægir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Until the Penal Battalion arrived."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Yes, until they arrived."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Many people were taken, mostly Ægir, but also people of other races who were close to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The rest of the Ægir left one by one. People say they left of their own accord, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you don't agree."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I... I don't know. I wasn't there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You seem to know a lot about these things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thorns knew a lot about these things.\nThe fate of the Ægir in this country was sealed the moment Iberia realized the threat from the ocean, when the Inquisition began using force to deal with its tentacles stretching out from the sea.\nThey had breathing room in some places; in others, they were not so lucky.\nThis town happened to be one of the 'others.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The fear of suppression has always hung over Iberia. Whether they left of their own accord or were forced to leave doesn't matter in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A worse fate awaited those who stayed than those who went into the barrenlands, or returned to the ocean."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Did you leave because of that too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So... why did you come back now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even I can see that life out there is good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A strange question."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do I need a reason?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiable Priest",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have you decided where you want to go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe outside, away from this country."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiable Priest",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your eyes are calm, my child."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiable Priest",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're the only one who didn't try to persuade me to leave together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You won't leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...You're not innocent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiable Priest",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha, perhaps."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiable Priest",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go, child. Your will has always been strong. Follow it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiable Priest",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Never stop thinking. We have the right to follow our thoughts, no matter where they lead us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Farewell, teacher."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't overthink it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Iberia provided an opportunity, and the other Ægir and I accepted its offer. There was something in it for both of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I knew a fool who believed that Iberia would change."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I don't care how it changes; I just want to do what I want to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You always seem so calm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Ægir who left, the ones who should have been our brethren..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Will they come back someday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe, if you wish it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aren't you doing all this in preparation for that day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you doing, Felipe?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why have you blocked the roads? What's with these strange machines?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop this absurdity at once and go home!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course I know what day it is, Uncle Pablo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Once, friends from a faraway land took our hands, and together we built the Golden Age."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And this was the day that our hands first came together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you babbling about...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Am I really babbling, Uncle Pablo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "T-That was ages ago..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "People don't bring it up anymore. Many don't even dare to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the Iberians should have remembered."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Today is a day to remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A day to remember?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've never heard of it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're too young to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We used to celebrate it when I was little. There were people frolicking in the square, day and night. We would call each other brothers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Ægir built new things. Ships that traveled on dry land, automatic fireworks, lighthouses that changed color on their own..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then why have I never heard about any of this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...We stopped celebrating them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After... all those terrible things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So... they're telling the truth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We used to celebrate this day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course we did!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's do it, Mr. Thorns!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A Liberi and an Ægir stand side-by-side in the crowd.\nTears gather in the eyes of the older townsfolk at the sight of it. Memories have faded with time and wordless oppression. Have they seen a scene like this in the past?\nAll eyes are on the Ægir as he lights the fuse.\nThey were happier times, better times."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Fireworks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fireworks in bright daylight..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The books were telling the truth..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe they'll write about this, someday."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean they'll write about me, just like they write about Captain Alfonso? Haha, I find that hard to believe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, Mr. Thorns, Mr. Thorns!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Felipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've got powder from the fireworks on your face!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Thorns",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Consider it part of the celebration."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
